'' Five shapes fbc refuses, each with one error on fbc's line (audit F-57): a second CASE
'' ELSE (fbc 35; the second won), FOR with no TO (12; an ICE), CASE IS without a
'' relational operator (285; reached clang), a word after a procedure header (3; dropped)
'' and END IF with no IF (110; it ENDED THE PROGRAM, 'if' read as the exit code).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -c tests/diagnostics/src/accept-invalid-blocks.bas -o tests/diagnostics/src/accept-invalid-blocks.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: accept-invalid-blocks.bas(5,1): error TKO0956
'' EXPECT-OUT: accept-invalid-blocks.bas(7,10): error TKO0401: expected 'to'
'' EXPECT-OUT: accept-invalid-blocks.bas(10,9): error TKO0401: expected 'a relational operator'
'' EXPECT-OUT: accept-invalid-blocks.bas(12,10): error TKO0420
'' EXPECT-OUT: accept-invalid-blocks.bas(14,5): error TKO0955: 'end if' closes no 'if' block
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
